    <briefdescription>
<para>CDS option. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The side of the swaption is set by choosing the side of the CDS. A receiver CDS option is a right to buy an underlying CDS selling protection and receiving a coupon. A payer CDS option is a right to buy an underlying CDS buying protection and paying coupon. </para>    </detaileddescription>
